# Mechanic: K'rrik grants life payment for ordinary black mana symbols.
# Forcing: Four Swamps offer full mana payment, while mixed choices should leave two untapped.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield leave no intervening decision.
# Failure modes: Missing choices or unchanged life indicate automatic payment rather than the selected method.
# Card roles: K'rrik grants payment permission. Phyrexian Obliterator supplies four ordinary black symbols. Libraries prevent draw losses.
# Protocol path: Cast, CastingTimeOptionsReq ManaType, selected payment, battlefield state.
